section.subsection:
The time period beginning on the day on which the commission orders a conference in accordance with Subsection (6) and ending on the day on which the conference adjourns may not be included in calculating a time period:

during which a levy is valid;
during which a depository institution is required to secure an amount in accordance with Section 59-1-1708;
for making the determination required by Subsection (1); or
for requiring a depository institution to release a portion of an amount to the commission in accordance with Section 59-1-1711.

subsection.subsection:
Subject to Subsection (9)(b), the time period beginning on the day on which a delinquent taxpayer files an action in accordance with Subsection (8) and ending on the day on which the action becomes final may not be included in calculating a time period:
during which a levy is valid;
during which a depository institution is required to secure an amount in accordance with Section 59-1-1708;
for making the determination required by Subsection (1); or
for requiring a depository institution to release a portion of an amount to the commission in accordance with Section 59-1-1711.
